---
description: Security-boundary requirements
globs: ["src/neuroai_workbench/server.py", "src/neuroai_workbench/evidence.py", "src/neuroai_workbench/events.py", "SECURITY.md", "THREAT_MODEL.md", "Dockerfile", "compose.yaml"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Keep the reference server local by default and fail clearly on unsafe configuration.
- Do not add authentication to the reference server and call it production-ready.
- Bound request sizes, sanitize paths, avoid command injection, and preserve defensive headers.
- Update `THREAT_MODEL.md` for every attack-surface change.
- Never put exploit details or protected evidence into public issues or fixtures.
